Condemning in the strongest terms the continued, illegal and unjustified attacks by Ansar Allah (Houthis) against commercial and merchant vessels in the Red Sea and the Gulf of Aden, including through the use of advanced weapons, which threaten maritime security, navigational rights, regional peace and stability and global supply chains,
