Stressing also the need to address the root causes of heightened regional tensions, including the ongoing conflict in Gaza and the question of Palestine, and to achieve a comprehensive, just and lasting peace in the Middle East in accordance with international law and relevant United Nations resolutions, including through the realization of a two-State solution,
